::warning file=testdata/output/sample.yaml,line=17,title=GAL001 traffic-guard::Checkout: 5xx ratio, all regions: ratio of rates with no traffic guard: at low traffic one failed request is a 100%25 error rate. Add `and on() sum(rate(...)) > N` or a guard grouped by the ratio's labels, clamp_min the denominator, or combine a request-rate query in the condition.
::warning file=testdata/output/sample.yaml,line=30,title=GAL003 exec-error-state::Checkout: 5xx ratio, all regions: execErrState is Alerting: a datasource timeout or query error pages as an outage. Use Error or KeepLast.
::notice file=testdata/output/sample.yaml,line=34,title=GAL007 annotations::Checkout: 5xx ratio, all regions: no runbook_url annotation: the responder has to find the runbook while paged. Link one.
::error file=testdata/output/sample.yaml,line=43,title=GAL006 histogram-quantile-le::Checkout p99 latency: histogram_quantile over sum by (service) drops the le label: Prometheus skips bucket series without le, so the query returns nothing and the alert never fires. Keep le in the grouping.
::error file=testdata/output/sample.yaml,line=61,title=GAL008 required-labels::Checkout p99 latency: missing required label "team": notification policies route on it, so this alert falls through to the default policy.
